                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A sharpening stone; a hard stone or piece of synthetically bonded hard minerals that has been formed with at least one flat surface, used to sharpen or hone an edged tool."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "da4d79af-8c40-4051-8569-8958cc8cce93",
                                                "sense_id": "caba41fd-bc73-3fe5-87d6-ae96f94fe6da",
                                                "text": "[…]for alwaies the dulneſſe of the foole, is the whetstone of the wits."
                                            },
